---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  name: 'Affiliate disclosure',
  description:
    'How Pick Your Row handles affiliate links, booking placeholders, and editorial independence. Joshua Israel Ventures LLC.',
  url: 'https://pickyourrow.com/disclosure/',
};
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate disclosure"
  description="How Pick Your Row handles affiliate links, booking placeholders, and editorial independence. No invented partner IDs. Joshua Israel Ventures LLC."
  canonicalPath="/disclosure/"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Disclosure</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title">Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Transparency first. If you buy or book through a partner link on this site, Pick Your Row may earn a commission.
      That does not change the price you pay.
    </p>

    <h2>Current status (September 2026)</h2>
    <p>
      Live paid affiliate accounts are not wired yet. Seat map and best seats pages use clearly labeled
      <strong>booking placeholders</strong> that open <a href="/book/">/book/</a>. Those stubs explain that partners
      such as Travelpayouts (or similar) can plug in later. We do <strong>not</strong> invent live affiliate IDs,
      tracking tokens, or fake “Book now” deep links.
    </p>

    <h2>What stays independent</h2>
    <ul class="clean">
      <li>Original SVG cabin schematics are editorial products, not paid airline placements.</li>
      <li>Best seat scores are heuristic opinions documented on <a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a>.</li>
      <li>We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any airline.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>FTC style principles</h2>
    <p>
      When partner links go live, we will label them as affiliate or sponsored where required, keep this disclosure
      easy to find from the footer and booking CTAs, and list active programs here. Until then, treat every booking
      button as a placeholder that routes through disclosure aware pages.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Email via <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>, or read <a href="/about/">About Pick Your Row</a>.
      Owner: Joshua Israel Ventures LLC.
    </p>

    <p class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href="/book/">Booking stub</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="/methodology/">Methodology</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="/airlines/">Browse airlines</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
